    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<style>*{overflow-wrap: break-word;} img {max-width:100% !important} </style><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">एआईटीयूसी के प्रथम अध्यक्ष लाला लाजपत राय थे, जो &#39;शेर-ए-पंजाब&#39; के नाम से भी जाने जाते हैं।</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>The first president of AITUC was Lala Lajpat Rai, also known as &#39;Sher-e-Punjab&#39;.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>",
